  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Leading through Learning Global Platform (LTLGP)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Leading through Learning Global Platform (LTLGP), formerly known as Leading through Learning Networks (LTLN). The LTLGP requirement is designed to support knowledge sharing, tool development and professional development iteratively as USAIDs education programs evolve, building knowledge and evidence. LTLGP will provide a way to cultivate learning networks in the areas of ensuring education programming is inclusive of marginalized populations; higher education; education systems strengthening (including public and private actors); and other relevant education areas.</narrative>
  </description>
